    <!--
        SUPPRESSION POLICY
        ==================
        CVEs are suppressed here only when:
          1. No upstream patch exists yet (newly published CVE, no fixed version available), OR
          2. The CVE is a false positive — attributed to a component we do not use.

        Each suppression includes the CVE ID, the reason, and the date added.
        Review and remove suppressions when upstream patches become available.

        IMPORTANT: packageUrl patterns cover all org.apache.tomcat.embed/* artifacts
        (tomcat-embed-core, tomcat-embed-websocket, tomcat-embed-el, etc.) because
        OWASP matches the same Tomcat CVEs against every embedded Tomcat jar.
        Same applies to all org.apache.logging.log4j/* artifacts.
    -->

